  "comment": "Mengaktifkan NAT (masquerade) ke eth0 Edit /etc/sysctl.conf net.ipv4.ip_forward=1 Masquerade sudo iptables -t nat -A POSTROUTING -o eth0 -j MASQUERADE sudo sh -c \"iptables-save &gt; /etc/iptables.ipv4.nat\" Edit /etc/rc.local sebelum \"exit 0\" tambahkan iptables-restore &lt; /etc/iptables.ipv4.nat Reboot reboot Pranala Menarik Internet Offline",
